# Episode 2: the model inside the real system on the RTL. The image is lm/mkdisk.sh: it holds
# LM.Mod, LM.Weights and two added lines in System.Tool. The system compiles the module
# itself, then the command is run with the middle button, as a reader would.
at 12000000
click 690 569 M
wait 20000000
click 690 581 M
wait 95000000
shot build/lm/lm_rtl.pbm
